---
import FadeIn from '../FadeIn.astro';
---

<section class="section ops-ai" id="ops-ai-explainer" aria-label="How we use AI">
  <div class="container--narrow">
    <FadeIn>
      <h2 class="ops-ai__heading">AI is the mechanism.<br /><span class="text-accent">Not the product.</span></h2>
    </FadeIn>

    <FadeIn delay={0.1}>
      <p class="text-body-lg ops-ai__lead">
        We don&rsquo;t sell &ldquo;AI ideas.&rdquo; We use AI to do three very specific&nbsp;jobs:
      </p>
    </FadeIn>

    <FadeIn delay={0.15}>
      <div class="ops-ai__methods">
        <ul class="list-dash">
          <li class="text-body"><strong>Map reality.</strong> We turn real days in your business&nbsp;&ndash; calls, tickets, screens, and spreadsheets&nbsp;&ndash; into clear workflows, failure points, and exception paths so everyone agrees what&rsquo;s actually&nbsp;happening.</li>
          <li class="text-body"><strong>Build the glue.</strong> We supervise AI agents to do the boring implementation work on top of a workflow engine (like n8n) so your existing CRM, scheduling, billing, and inbox tools finally talk to each&nbsp;other.</li>
          <li class="text-body"><strong>Keep it safe.</strong> Every automation runs inside explicit guardrails, with humans reviewing changes, logs, and edge cases before anything goes&nbsp;live.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </FadeIn>

    <FadeIn delay={0.2}>
      <p class="text-body-lg ops-ai__closer">
        The result isn&rsquo;t &ldquo;AI in a slide deck.&rdquo; It&rsquo;s pulling humans out of the
        10&ndash;20% of work they should never have been doing in the first&nbsp;place.
      </p>
    </FadeIn>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ops-ai {
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
  }

  .ops-ai__heading {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.5vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ops-ai__heading::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 32px;
    height: 1.5px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .ops-ai__lead {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .ops-ai__methods {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    padding: 32px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-accent-soft);
  }

  .ops-ai__label {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .ops-ai__closer {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }
</style>
